# Everything secret is gitignored by directory. `secrets/` is the
# only place secrets live; assets/ + module .nix files are always
# tracked. Catch all depths.
**/secrets/
**/secrets

# Backup files we may create during refactors.
*.bak
*.bak.*

# Nix build artifacts (in case anyone runs nix-build here).
result
result-*

# Editor noise.
*.swp
*.swo
